            "label": {
                "en": "Harmonic Drive Joint",
                "es": "Articulación de Harmonic Drive"
            },
            "description": {
                "en": "Parametric Strain Wave Gear (Harmonic Drive): the zero-backlash actuator at the heart of the Chronos-SCARA Kinetic Layer. Maintains perfect viscosity between input and output shafts."
